  <h1>Interested In Selling In EU And USA</h1>
  <p>Introducing the highest-quality nitro coffee and tea for your business, a better alternative to standard cold brew.</p>

  <h2>Long shelf stability</h2>
  <p>Kegs are shelf stable for up to six months (180 days) with no refrigerated storage needed.</p>

  <h2>Tap on demand</h2>
  <p>Serve on tap with no barista required, saving labor.</p>

  <h2>19L (5 gal) kegs</h2>
  <p>Specialized 19L (5 gal) kegs are pressurized with nitrogen. The PET keg is recyclable.</p>

  <h2>Coffee shops, offices and food service</h2>
  <p>For coffee shops, offices, food trucks and food service, with hot and cold countertop dispensers. See <a href="/kegerators/">serving equipment</a>.</p>

  <h2>Wholesale distributors</h2>
  <p>Distributor and wholesale partners are welcome; see <a href="/howtobuy/">how to buy</a>.</p>

  <h2>Private label</h2>
  <p>Your own coffee or tea can be filled in Bona Fide kegs under your brand, with brand collaboration available.</p>

  <h2>Rental in the Czech Republic</h2>
  <p>Equipment rental for events in the Czech Republic: see <a href="/hot-nitro-equipment-rental/">equipment rental</a>.</p>

  <h2>Nitro information and quiz</h2>
  <p>Learn more in <a href="/nitro-coffee-questions/">Nitro Coffee Questions</a>. The quiz is not yet rebuilt.</p>

  <h2>Why Us?</h2>
  <p>180-day shelf-stable kegs, no refrigerated storage, proprietary brewing technology, brand collaboration, and hot or cold countertop dispensers.</p>

  <p><a href="/contact-bona-fide-nitro-coffee-and-tea/">Contact us</a> to talk.</p>
